So no lost time, in my opinion.

00:03:59.320 --> 00:04:01.480
Okay, Sarah.
- I love a good ornament.

00:04:01.480 --> 00:04:03.090
- Yeah, then you make a knot
and you slide it off, yeah.

00:04:03.090 --> 00:04:03.923
Just slide it off.

