00:04:04.756 --> 00:04:06.010
Then you end up getting

00:04:06.010 --> 00:04:07.478
something that looks like this.

00:04:07.478 --> 00:04:10.360
So in front of all of us, we already have

00:04:10.360 --> 00:04:12.180
